msgstr ""
"<strong>Strani dogodkov:</strong> Samodejno ustvarite elegantne strani "
"dogodkov z urniki, biografijami govorcev in prijavnimi obrazci."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Flexible Plans:</strong> Create different subscription models—"
