#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We welcomed mindfulness coach <strong>Leona Vervain</strong>, known for her "
"grounded, no-nonsense approach to meditation and breathwork. With a "
"background in neuroscience and a decade of experience leading retreats "
"across Europe, Leona guided us through a 90-minute session called <em>“The "
"Art of the Pause.”</em>"
msgstr ""
"Gostili smo trenerko čuječnosti <strong>Leono Vervain</strong>, znano po "
"svojem prizemljenem, stvarnem pristopu k meditaciji in dihalnim vajam. Z "
"nevroznanstvenim ozadjem in desetletjem izkušenj z vodenjem umikov po Evropi "
"nas je Leona popeljala skozi 90-minutno srečanje z naslovom <em>»Umetnost "
"premora.«</em>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We’re grateful to Leona for holding such a safe, welcoming space—and to "
"every member who showed up with openness and intention."
msgstr ""
"Hvaležni smo Leoni, da je ustvarila tako varen in vključujoč prostor — ter "
"vsakemu članu, ki je prišel z odprtostjo in namenom."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"What followed was a simple yet powerful practice: guided breathing, a short "
"seated meditation, and a few gentle exercises to reconnect with the body. No "
"incense. No awkward chants. Just presence."
msgstr ""
"Kar je sledilo, je bila preprosta, a učinkovita praksa: vodeno dihanje, "
"kratka sedeča meditacija in nekaj nežnih vaj za ponovno vzpostavitev stika s "
"telesom. Brez kadil. Brez nerodnih manter. Samo prisotnost."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"What this evening reminded us is that slowness isn’t laziness—it’s a skill. "
"One we rarely practice, and yet deeply need. In the midst of full calendars "
"and constant noise, it was refreshing to press pause, not just individually, "
"but together."
msgstr ""
"Današnji večer nas je spomnil, da upočasnitev ni lenoba – je veščina. "
"Veščina, ki jo le redko vadimo, a jo kljub temu močno potrebujemo. Sredi "
"polnih urnikov in nenehnega hrupa je bilo osvežujoče pritisniti premor, ne "
"le vsak zase, temveč skupaj."

